{"id":"4350a4d66b0db7a7","group":"29","path":"29/29-lem-iter-space.md","title":"有界元数迭代的确定性空间上界","display":"lem-iter-space — 有界元数迭代的确定性空间上界","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-lem-iter-space","aliases":["29-lem-iter-space"],"display":"lem-iter-space — 有界元数迭代的确定性空间上界","depends_on":["[[29-df-iter]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]"],"source_locator":"Lemma 10.21, p.165, DjVu scan 180","source_basis":"原书文本层；已核对空间模拟证明并显式计入轮数计数器"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-lem-iter-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-lem-iter-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-iter-space — 有界元数迭代的确定性空间上界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" href=\"?note=bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" title=\"29-df-iter\">29-df-iter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 10.21, p.165, DjVu scan 180"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；已核对空间模拟证明并显式计入轮数计数器"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为固定有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 表示域大小，输入编码长度另记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>，编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" href=\"?note=bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" title=\"29-df-iter\">29-df-iter</a>；确定性空间类使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 的只读输入、工作空间及停机约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau]\\)</span> 在此为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\)</span>；每个合法域枚举均编码同一个结构查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 10.21，印刷页165、扫描页180。已核对本页论证；本地补足固定轮数语义下的计数器。对某个查询固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系，保存前后两组关系表需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2m n^k\">\\(2m n^k\\)</span> 位。每个下一轮表项由固定 FO 更新公式求值，量词深度固定，其变量栈及输入地址仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\log n)\">\\(O(\\log n)\\)</span> 位；初态和最终 FO 读出同理。重复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\,2^{c n^k}\">\\(d\\,2^{c n^k}\\)</span> 轮的计数器需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(c n^k+\\log d)\">\\(O(c n^k+\\log d)\\)</span> 位，因此总工作空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(n^k)\">\\(O(n^k)\\)</span>，且机器在指定轮数后停机。该论证不以输入编码长度替换域大小，也不把任意不可计算的迭代次数包含在这个指数族内。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-iter","status":"resolved","id":"bc4ad8dba28adfd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iter]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\geq1$，$\\tau$ 为固定有限关系词汇；$n$ 表示域大小，输入编码长度另记 $N$，编码见 [[29-df-bin-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iter","status":"resolved","id":"bc4ad8dba28adfd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-iter]]；确定性空间类使用 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 的只读输入、工作空间及停机约定。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-iter]]；确定性空间类使用 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 的只读输入、工作空间及停机约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n^k,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"2m n^k","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\log n)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\,2^{c n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"O(c n^k+\\log d)","display":false},{"tex":"O(n^k)","display":false}],"bytes":1812,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-lem-ind-fo-iteration]]、[[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]、[[29-lem-iter-space]] — 块展开、有限轨道与空间上界"},{"id":"73e3feb902982212","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Theorem 10.16，印刷页163、扫描页178的三项等式已查看原图；三段证明见 Lemmas 10.17、10.20、10.21，印刷页164–165、扫描页179–180。已核对证明结构；未逐项重验 Claim 10.19 中的全部量词块符号变换。本次补回原书的 ITER 项，并把机器类及关系迭代类显式拉回到 VAR 使用的同一有序对论域，避免直接比较结构查询与有序对查询。空间上界的本地逐项论证另见 [[29-lem-iter-space]]。旧文件以有限变量 FO(PFP) 替代 VAR，不能据该定理取得相同结论；已有正文纠正继续保留。$n$ 始终为域大小，不能因输入词汇元数改变而换成编码长度 $N$。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-iter-space]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-iter-space|29-lem-iter-space]]"}],"outgoing":["bc4ad8dba28adfd5","2017fdd1c0072445","57d3a90cf94ef42e","92256ad8556a5baf"]}